                <text type="warning_situation">
				<p>MINOR FLOODING OCCURRING ALONG THE BREMER RIVER AT WANSTEAD RD AND LIKELY AT LANGHORNE CREEK TUESDAY AFTERNOON</p>

				<p/>
				<p>Moderate to locally heavy rainfall has been observed across the Bremer catchment since Monday afternoon. This has caused river and creek level rises, and minor flooding is occurring along the Bremer River at Wanstead Rd and is likely at Langhorne Creek Tuesday afternoon.</p>

				<p/>

                </text>
                <element type="severity">Minor</element>
            </forecast-period>
